{"id":"naturaleza","lemma":"naturaleza","pos":"noun","rank":1019,"glosses":["nature"],"ipa":"/natuɾaˈleθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"naturalezas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-naturaleza.wav","examples":[{"text":"Amo la naturaleza.","en":"I love nature.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440215","words":[{"g":"master"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La naturaleza está llena de misterio.","en":"Nature is full of mystery.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522034","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"full","l":"lleno"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"mystery"}]},{"text":"Me voy a responder a la llamada de la naturaleza.","en":"I'm just going to answer the call of nature.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693877","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to answer, to reply"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"call"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[7,9,"of the"]]},{"text":"La naturaleza es cruel.","en":"Nature is cruel.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"cruel"}]},{"text":"Él es vago por naturaleza.","en":"He is lazy by nature.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636445","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"wanderer"},{"g":"for / by"},null]}]}